@startuml assistant-classes
!include style.iuml
title LazyFinance — Class View\nGrounded text assistant · selected NestJS and TypeScript types
top to bottom direction
hide circle
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor<<boundary>> #DAE8FC
  BorderColor<<boundary>> #6C8EBF
  BackgroundColor<<assistant>> #E1D5E7
  BorderColor<<assistant>> #9673A6
  BackgroundColor<<interface>> #F7F2FA
  BorderColor<<interface>> #9673A6
}

class AssistantHttp <<boundary>> {
  +turn()
}
class AssistantService <<assistant>> {
  +stream()
  +conversation()
  +requireConsent()
}
interface AssistantRuntime <<interface>> {
  +run(input: AssistantRuntimeInput)
}
class AiSdkAssistantRuntime <<assistant>> {
  +run(input: AssistantRuntimeInput)
}
class DemonstrationAssistantRuntime <<assistant>> {
  +run(input: AssistantRuntimeInput)
}
class AssistantTurnTools <<assistant>> {
  +sources: AssistantSource[]
  +read()
  +propose()
  +revise()
  +actionStatus()
  +grounded()
}
class FinancialReads {
  +tools
}
class ActionsService {
  +prepare()
  +revise()
  +get()
  +approve()
}
class AssistantConsentService <<identity>> {
  +state()
  +requireAccepted()
}
class PersistenceClient {
  +user(userId)
}

AssistantHttp --> AssistantService : delegates NDJSON turn
AssistantService --> AssistantRuntime : injected runtime
AssistantService ..> AssistantTurnTools : <<create>>\nper acquired turn
AssistantService --> AssistantConsentService : checks policy
AssistantService --> PersistenceClient : stores owned turns
AssistantTurnTools --> FinancialReads : owned reads
AssistantTurnTools --> ActionsService : prepare / revise / status only
AssistantConsentService --> PersistenceClient : reads saved consent
ActionsService --> PersistenceClient : signed financial commands
AiSdkAssistantRuntime ..|> AssistantRuntime
DemonstrationAssistantRuntime ..|> AssistantRuntime

legend bottom
  Solid arrows: held dependency. Dashed arrow: creation. Open triangle: interface realization.
  Selected members only; signatures are abbreviated. Environment DI and transitive financial services are omitted.
  The runtime receives bounded callbacks, not a persistence client or approval operation.
  The authenticated user's saved-card approval enters separately; the demonstration runtime calls no live model.
endlegend
@enduml
